        <summary>
          <para>Events are reported only when the value changes. Event delivery rate can be limited by setting appropriate value for rate parameter of SensorManager.registerListener(SensorEventListener,Sensor,int) Note: If other applications are requesting a higher rate, the sensor data might be delivered at faster rates than requested.</para>
