      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Events are reported in one-shot mode. Upon detection of an event, the sensor deactivates itself and then sends a single event. Sensors of this reporting mode must be registered to using SensorManager.requestTriggerSensor(TriggerEventListener,Sensor).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/Sensor#REPORTING_MODE_ONE_SHOT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.Sensor.REPORTING_MODE_ONE_SHOT</code>.</a></format></para>
